        <ExplanationTxt>A DRAFT IS PROVIDED TO THE EXECUTIVE DIRECTOR AND DIRECTOR OF FINANCE FOR REVIEW. ONCE REVIEWED, THE EXECUTIVE DIRECTOR FORWARDS TO THE BOARD FOR REVIEW. ONCE THE BOARD INFORMS THE EXECUTIVE DIRECTOR THAT THEY HAVE REVIEWED IT, THE FINAL COPY IS FORWARDED TO BOARD CHAIRPERSON FOR DIGITAL SIGNATURE.</ExplanationTxt>
